<div class="info-page">

    <header class="info-hero">
        <span class="info-eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="info-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="info-subtitle">
            Your privacy matters to us. Here is a clear summary of what information Stayora collects and how we protect it.
        </p>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></p>
    </header>

    <div class="info-card-white">
        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>When you create an account or use Stayora, we may collect:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Account details such as your name, email address, phone number, and profile photo.</li>
                <li>Authentication information including encrypted passwords or Google OAuth identifiers.</li>
                <li>Booking details, property listings, room information, and guest reviews you submit.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>To create and secure your account, including OTP verification and password resets.</li>
                <li>To process room bookings and connect guests with verified hosts.</li>
                <li>To improve search speed, display accurate property listings, and prevent fraud or spam.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>3. Cookies &amp; Sessions</h2>
            <p>
                Stayora uses secure session cookies to keep you signed in and protect your account. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                We protect passwords using industry-standard hashing (bcrypt), enforce rate limiting on sensitive routes, and store sessions securely.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>5. Your Rights &amp; Contact</h2>
            <p>
                You may request updates or deletion of your account information at any time by contacting us at
                <a href="mailto:support@bookstayora.in">support@bookstayora.in</a> or calling
                <a href="tel:+919212684600">+91 92126 84600</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>

</div>
